sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant A as API
  U->>A: GET /api/auth/csrf/
  A-->>U: Set-Cookie csrftoken
  U->>A: POST /api/auth/login/ (X-CSRFToken)
  A->>A: authenticate, rotate session key, audit
  A-->>U: Set-Cookie sessionid (HttpOnly) + user and memberships
  U->>A: any request (cookie + CSRF header on writes)
  A->>A: SessionAuthentication, then membership + role + object checks
  U->>A: POST /api/auth/logout/
  A-->>U: session destroyed
